Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Audio: package the default effects config in the HAL APEX

The example effect service resolves its default configuration relative to its
APEX. Package the existing default configuration beside the service.

Change-Id: I721a75042e1b8222e1f99bb1f09a688b950d610d
---
 audio/aidl/default/apex/com.android.hardware.audio/Android.bp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/audio/aidl/default/apex/com.android.hardware.audio/Android.bp b/audio/aidl/default/apex/com.android.hardware.audio/Android.bp
index 510fee5f84..3694854e4d 100644
--- a/audio/aidl/default/apex/com.android.hardware.audio/Android.bp
+++ b/audio/aidl/default/apex/com.android.hardware.audio/Android.bp
@@ -50,6 +50,7 @@ apex {
         "android.hardware.bluetooth.audio.xml",
         "audio_eraser_classifier_model",
         "audio_eraser_separator_model",
+        "audio_effects_config.xml",
     ],
     required: [
         "aidl_audio_set_configurations_bfbs",
